From 1c9387875bf0fd560585e1594dd82df633e5326f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Salis Dev <dev@salis.app>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 08:38:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(storefront): SEO metadata + Error Boundary + product
 page improvements
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

SEO:
- layout.tsx: full Metadata object with title template, og:image, twitter cards
- robots: index+follow for Google crawler
- NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL env variable for metadataBase

Error Boundary:
- components/ui/ErrorBoundary.tsx: Class component with reset button
- Wraps ProductGrid in page.tsx — prevents full page crash on Convex errors
- componentDidCatch for error logging

Product page:
- Responsive grid: auto-fit minmax(280px) works on mobile
- Cleaner skeleton with proper animation delays

Env:
- .env.local.example with all required variables documented
